---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description={`Privacy policy for ${SITE.title}`}>
  <article class="reading">
    <header class="post-header">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="post-desc">Effective Date: October 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="post-content">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy describes how pastelloclub (&quot;we,&quot;
        &quot;us,&quot; or &quot;our&quot;) collects, uses, and discloses
        information when you visit pastelloclub.com (the
        &quot;Site&quot;). By using the Site, you agree to the practices
        described in this Policy.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>a. Information you provide voluntarily.</strong> If you submit
        your email address through our signup form, we collect that address for
        the purpose of sending you the content you requested. Submission is
        entirely optional.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>b. Information collected automatically.</strong> Like most
        websites, the Site may automatically receive standard technical
        information from your browser and device, such as IP address, browser
        type, referring pages, and pages visited. We may use third-party
        analytics services to measure aggregate site usage. Any future addition
        of specific analytics or measurement tools will be reflected in this
        Policy.
      </p>

      <h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Send the emails or updates you requested;</li>
        <li>Understand, in aggregate, how visitors use the Site; and</li>
        <li>Operate, maintain, and improve the Site.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Sharing of Information</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We do not
        share your email address with third parties for their own marketing
        purposes. Information may be disclosed only where required by law,
        legal process, or to protect the rights, property, or safety of the
        Site or its users.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Affiliate and Referral Links</h2>
      <p>
        The Site contains affiliate and referral links to third-party products
        and services (including, for example, links to Amazon, eBay, and
        service providers we use). If you make a purchase or sign up through
        such a link, we may receive a commission or referral credit at no
        additional cost to you. These third parties operate under their own
        privacy policies, which govern any information they collect, and we
        encourage you to review them.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        The Site is directed to parents and caregivers and is not directed to
        children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information
        from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us
        personal information, please contact us so we can delete it.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Your Choices</h2>
      <p>
        You may stop receiving our emails at any time by using the unsubscribe
        link included in any email or by contacting us at the address below,
        and we will remove your address from our records. You may also decline
        automatic collection by adjusting your browser settings or using
        widely available blocking tools.
      </p>

      <h2>7. California Residents</h2>
      <p>
        Under California law, California residents have the right to request
        disclosure of the categories of personal information collected and to
        request deletion of their personal information, subject to certain
        exceptions. Because we do not sell personal information and collect
        only the information described above, we will honor such requests by
        deleting the information we hold about you. To make a request, contact
        us at the address below.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Policy from time to time. The
        &quot;Effective Date&quot; above indicates when the current version
        took effect. Material changes will be reflected on this page, and
        continued use of the Site after changes constitutes acceptance of the
        updated Policy.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this Policy may be directed to{' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
